        "az": "$x^2 + {b}x + {c} = 0$ tənliyinin köklərini artan sırada \";\" ilə yazın.",
        "ru": "Запишите корни уравнения $x^2 + {b}x + {c} = 0$ по возрастанию через \";\".",
        "en": "Write the roots of $x^2 + {b}x + {c} = 0$ in increasing order, separated by \";\"."
      },
      "params": {"x1": {"min": -6, "max": 6, "not": [0]}, "x2": {"min": -6, "max": 6, "not": [0]}},
      "derived": {"b": "-(x1 + x2)", "c": "x1 * x2"},
      "where": ["x1 < x2", "Abs(b) > 1"],
      "answer": ["x1", "x2"],
      "original": {"x1": 1, "x2": 4}, "original_answer": [1, 4],
      "explanation": {
        "az": "Viyet teoremi: köklər $x_1 = {x1}$ və $x_2 = {x2}$.",
        "ru": "По теореме Виета корни $x_1 = {x1}$ и $x_2 = {x2}$.",
        "en": "By Vieta's theorem the roots are $x_1 = {x1}$ and $x_2 = {x2}$."
      }
    },
